<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1><a href="monstereditor">The Monster Editor</a></h1>

<p>The monster editor will allow you to modify the database of monsters as well as all of their stats. You can also edit the</p>
<p>monster information and delete them as needed.</p>

<h1><a href="monstereditorregex">The Page Parser</a></h1>

<p>This will allow you to copy pages from the monster manual and automatically get monster stats. You will just need to have</p>
<p>some text to copy into via a PDF or similar tool then paste it inside the input box and let the RegEx do it's magic</p>

<h1><a href="encountereditor">The Encounter Editor</a></h1>

<p>The encounter editor allows you to create combat encounters. Within these encounters you can include a description of what</p>
<p>the encounter is about. You can also add and remove monsters that are created with the monster editor to the encounter with</p>
<p>the click of a button.</p>
